{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Nom's World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the beautiful world of Faewoods, befriend cute creatures called Nom, sell nom produce, earn income to upgrade. Manage your ranch, combine traits to create the ultimate Nom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/cb02ac58f2b53be5ca96743fd8b62e90.poster.avif?t=1771138195\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/cb02ac58f2b53be5ca96743fd8b62e90.webm?t=1771138195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/cb02ac58f2b53be5ca96743fd8b62e90.mp4?t=1771138195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranch &amp; Earn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ranch, feed the nom, and collect cores to sell. Use your earnings to upgrade and grow even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/2ee69eaaa040062b70eafe7424295e80.poster.avif?t=1771138195\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/2ee69eaaa040062b70eafe7424295e80.webm?t=1771138195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/2ee69eaaa040062b70eafe7424295e80.mp4?t=1771138195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Noms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find rare noms type that can only be found through mysteries and puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/12140f8c4ab029fc79a6ea5f6171b601.poster.avif?t=1771138195\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/12140f8c4ab029fc79a6ea5f6171b601.webm?t=1771138195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/12140f8c4ab029fc79a6ea5f6171b601.mp4?t=1771138195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Locals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet up and assist the locals with their troubles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/41e26c19e6ee38deed15b25d7bd69c74.poster.avif?t=1771138195\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/41e26c19e6ee38deed15b25d7bd69c74.webm?t=1771138195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/extras/41e26c19e6ee38deed15b25d7bd69c74.mp4?t=1771138195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555140?t=1771138195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555140?t=1771138195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/37f3f0f60f4d03d038ff7692b3ce45a3217d4f14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771138195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555140/37f3f0f60f4d03d038ff7692b3ce45a3217d4f14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771138195","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"